      "maxDataPoints": 600,
      "description": "The current lap's clock, extrapolated on the pit side so it keeps counting through a radio dropout and corrects at the next crossing. Tenths while running (m:ss.t); the time announced at the crossing is definitive and shows milliseconds. A gated clock shows \u2014 instead of holding a stale number.",
